{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1098877-changing-2e-kickstarter-i-m-lost","id":1098877,"title":"Changing 2e/ Kickstarter - I'm lost","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-05-31T13:49:42-07:00","id":1098877,"title":"Changing 2e/ Kickstarter - I'm lost","content":"Sorry to ask what I know is a frustrating question but I'm confused. I understand from the Onyx website that 2e is not out yet and I cannot see it on Kickstarter. However, there are a number of threads which talk about creating 2e characters (suggesting a preview or something had been released) and a few references to it having been launched as a kickstarter.<br /> <br /> Have I misunderstood or completely missed something?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13060-akril","name":"Akril","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-31T13:54:44-07:00","id":1098880,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Akril</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1098877-changing-2e-kickstarter-i-m-lost#post1098877\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sorry to ask what I know is a frustrating question but I'm confused. I understand from the Onyx website that 2e is not out yet and I cannot see it on Kickstarter. However, there are a number of threads which talk about creating 2e characters (suggesting a preview or something had been released) and a few references to it having been launched as a kickstarter.<br /> <br /> Have I misunderstood or completely missed something?</div> </div> </div> </div>Two things:<br /> <br /> Lost 2e hasn't been on Kickstarter, and there are no definite plans to do so, although it's been floated as a possibility (cross your fingers). The previous developer of Lost 2e posted some drafts of character creation and new abilities, among other things. He left the project, so the book is still being tweaked, and those drafts aren't necessarily current. That's what people are likely referring to.<br /> <br /> Second thing, you might have seen people mention the Changeling: The <i>Dreaming </i>Kickstarter, which did happen a while back, but isn't related to Lost 2e except for being a &quot;changeling&quot; game.<br /> <br /> Hope that helps!<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-31T14:07:26-07:00","id":1098888,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yossarian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1098877-changing-2e-kickstarter-i-m-lost?p=1098880#post1098880\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Two things:<br /> <br /> Lost 2e hasn't been on Kickstarter, and there are no definite plans to do so, although it's been floated as a possibility (cross your fingers). The previous developer of Lost 2e posted some drafts of character creation and new abilities, among other things. He left the project, so the book is still being tweaked, and those drafts aren't necessarily current. That's what people are likely referring to.<br /> <br /> Second thing, you might have seen people mention the Changeling: The <i>Dreaming </i>Kickstarter, which did happen a while back, but isn't related to Lost 2e except for being a &amp;quot;changeling&amp;quot; game.<br /> <br /> Hope that helps!</div> </div> </div> </div> More like a radical over haul then tweaks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-31T14:37:29-07:00","id":1098900,"title":"","content":"Ah that's great. Yes I may have confused the Changeling games. Thanks for the clarification.<br /> <br /> I assume then that 2e is not close to release?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13060-akril","name":"Akril","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-31T16:06:04-07:00","id":1098928,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Akril</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1098877-changing-2e-kickstarter-i-m-lost?p=1098900#post1098900\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ah that's great. Yes I may have confused the Changeling games. Thanks for the clarification.<br /> <br /> I assume then that 2e is not close to release?</div> </div> </div> </div>Last I heard it's in development a stage after 2nd draft. But best to check the monday notes to see where it sits","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-31T18:29:08-07:00","id":1098955,"title":"","content":"I believe there was a large file where there were enough 2e notes, excerpts, and previews to make a <i>Lost</i> character. A lot of it may be obsolete now, though, but I'm not sure because it's not one of the games I'm particularly into","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1574"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-31T18:29:48-07:00","id":1098956,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1098877-changing-2e-kickstarter-i-m-lost?p=1098888#post1098888\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> More like a radical over haul then tweaks.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hah, doubtful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-02T07:29:26-07:00","id":1099507,"title":"","content":"Look at what has already change, bukworks gone in favour of bargains, meaning the court system has to be restructured, new critters added, Dream Bastions gone, replaced by dream roads, the very theme of the hedge has been changed from pain. And that is what we know so far. <br /> <br /> Now a lot of that is interesting, but it's pretty major changes, not simple tweeks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-02T07:56:22-07:00","id":1099522,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1098877-changing-2e-kickstarter-i-m-lost?p=1099507#post1099507\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Look at what has already change, bukworks gone in favour of bargains, meaning the court system has to be restructured, new critters added, Dream Bastions gone, replaced by dream roads, the very theme of the hedge has been changed from pain. And that is what we know so far.<br /> <br /> Now a lot of that is interesting, but it's pretty major changes, not simple tweeks.</div> </div> </div> </div>Also a regalia system was added which changes the contract system, and the chapter layout changed so the y splat seems to have gone to Courts rather than Kiths anymore unless chapter one had Seemings, Kiths, and Courts.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-02T08:44:14-07:00","id":1099535,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1098877-changing-2e-kickstarter-i-m-lost?p=1099507#post1099507\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Look at what has already change, bukworks gone in favour of bargains, meaning the court system has to be restructured,</div> </div> </div> </div>To all appearances the Bargains involved are narratively identical to Approaches without the easily-misunderstood framing of them as part of a preexisting narrative.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> the very theme of the hedge has been changed from pain. </div> </div> </div>Again, &quot;the Hedge is pain&quot; was an easily-misunderstood framing of what is functionally an identical end presentation to &quot;the Hedge is a physical space where the dangers of any given pursuit are manifest.&quot;<br /> \u200b<br /> The biggest change that's actually visible at this point on the surface level is how changelings' interaction with dreaming works. That's kind of major on a how-do-changelings-structure-their-day-to-day-lives angle, but almost every other change to the previewed material so far can be readily addressed as a shift to broader framing rather than a fundamental alteration of the concepts. This is still Changeling: the Lost.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>milo v3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1098877-changing-2e-kickstarter-i-m-lost?p=1099522#post1099522\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also a regalia system was added which changes the contract system,</div> </div> </div> </div>The Regalia system changes the <i>organization of</i> Arcadian Contracts. Things explicitly stated in the set of posts where we learned about it included &quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1071445-goblin-contract-preview?p=1071586#post1071586\">a lot of the powers are the same as in the preview drafts.</a>&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> and the chapter layout changed so the y splat seems to have gone to Courts rather than Kiths anymore unless chapter one had Seemings, Kiths, and Courts. </div> </div> </div>Courts have literally always been the changeling Y-splat. &quot;Y-splat&quot; is not just a term for &quot;the second major axis of character differentiation&quot; and even if it was then 2e had given that role to <i>seemings</i>. A Court is a mystical/political/philosophical/psychological affinity that can be changed in the course of the story and is not an ingrained aspect of the character's magical nature. Kiths don't fill that role in either iteration of the new edition.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-04T01:48:30-07:00","id":1100050,"title":"","content":"Just chill out and relax, everyone who worries how Changeling will turn out to be. A few names getting changed or added aren't going to be critical.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-04T08:08:30-07:00","id":1100131,"title":"","content":"I'm not freak out, I'm completely chill, just pointed out the changes we're more extensive then a touch. I'm still looking forward to paying the game and I'm hoping there is a Changeling Kickstarter campaign after Monarchies of Mau, maybe in July.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-06T05:58:32-07:00","id":1100792,"title":"","content":"I was wrong Dark Eras 2 is going to be the next kickstarter not changeling.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-06T08:06:03-07:00","id":1100841,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1098877-changing-2e-kickstarter-i-m-lost?p=1100050#post1100050\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just chill out and relax, everyone who worries how Changeling will turn out to be. A few names getting changed or added aren't going to be critical.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, that's not happening.<br /> <br /> Look, I'm excited for Rose's take on Changeling. Rose is a fantastic writer and developer, and I'm sure her game will be great. But I absolutely adored David's Changeling, and until I know how much of it will survive into Rose's Changeling, I can't just stop being apprehensive about it. It's not that I'm worried Changeling 2e isn't going to be good, it's that I saw something I loved, and now I'm seeing it changing, but I have no clear indication of how much it's changing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-06T11:52:19-07:00","id":1100902,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1098877-changing-2e-kickstarter-i-m-lost?p=1100841#post1100841\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah, that's not happening.<br /> <br /> Look, I'm excited for Rose's take on Changeling. Rose is a fantastic writer and developer, and I'm sure her game will be great. But I absolutely adored David's Changeling, and until I know how much of it will survive into Rose's Changeling, I can't just stop being apprehensive about it. It's not that I'm worried Changeling 2e isn't going to be good, it's that I saw something I loved, and now I'm seeing it changing, but I have no clear indication of how much it's changing.</div> </div> </div> </div> Well I certainly can't blame you for that. Perhaps another dev blog would help.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-06T12:33:50-07:00","id":1100921,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1098877-changing-2e-kickstarter-i-m-lost?p=1100902#post1100902\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Well I certainly can't blame you for that. Perhaps another dev blog would help.</div> </div> </div> </div>Honestly, each successive dev blog was only making this feeling worse. If they showed something that was more or less the same with some minor tweaks, that might help. If they published a blog post saying &quot;Kiths, Seemings, and Contracts are staying more or less the same, but Courts, Oneriomancy, and Pledges are being completely re-written&quot; (just for example, I'm not attached to those specific things), that would definitely help. But continuing to preview things that were significantly different without showing what would stay the same was extremely distressing and I'm honestly glad they stopped.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-06T14:39:43-07:00","id":1100967,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1098877-changing-2e-kickstarter-i-m-lost?p=1100921#post1100921\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Honestly, each successive dev blog was only making this feeling worse. If they showed something that was more or less the same with some minor tweaks, that might help. If they published a blog post saying &quot;Kiths, Seemings, and Contracts are staying more or less the same, but Courts, Oneriomancy, and Pledges are being completely re-written&quot; (just for example, I'm not attached to those specific things), that would definitely help. But continuing to preview things that were significantly different without showing what would stay the same was extremely distressing and I'm honestly glad they stopped.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah...about that...<br /> <br /> This exchange happened a month ago on the Dark Eras Companion backer PDF thread. Hill's name came up in it. RichT had this to say (bolded relevant part)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1065560-dark-eras-companion-backer-pdf?p=1087834#post1087834\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Perhaps some clarity in why a different direction was taken from what David Hill had already done on Changeling would placate the concerns of those who are David Hill fans who are upset with how things went down, to reduce any misunderstandings that may have occurred. Just a friendly suggestion that could help dispell any unfortunate rumours or misunderstandings.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RichT</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1065560-dark-eras-companion-backer-pdf?p=1087905#post1087905\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>We've already made it clear that we're not going to go into the details in public.</b> The point here isn't that situation, the point is that Hayley, who has access to people who could clearly explain that situation btw, has posted blaming a conspiracy to deny her credit where none exists. There is a limit on the DTRPG site, and some books have lots of writers so we can't fit them all. It happens.</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1065560-dark-eras-companion-backer-pdf/page8\">Thread page for full context</a><br /> <br /> (Disclosure: I have no personal stake in &quot;Hill's CtL2 vs Rose's CtL2&quot;. Just hoping that a good game comes out of all of this, and if people don't want to support Rose's version due to not being the version they were initially sold on, that's their prerogative)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4418,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","user":"tasti man LH","date":". 06-06-2017, 05:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-06T14:56:59-07:00","id":1100972,"title":"","content":"Question about Kiths. My understanding is that in 2e, Kiths are not tied to a changeling's Seeming the way they were in 1e. Is this still true now that 2e is being revamped?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Our society is held together by the thinnest of threads: that exquisitely refined sense of tribal order.<br /> Edith Wharton, The Age of Innocence<br /> <br /> I am a huge fan of both the Trinity Universe and the classic World of Darkness.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12799-spellfire22","name":"Spellfire22","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"43"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-06T15:20:00-07:00","id":1100979,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1098877-changing-2e-kickstarter-i-m-lost?p=1100967#post1100967\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah...about that...<br /> <br /> This exchange happened a month ago on the Dark Eras Companion backer PDF thread. Hill's name came up in it. RichT had this to say (bolded relevant part)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1065560-dark-eras-companion-backer-pdf/page8\">Thread page for full context</a></div> </div> </div> </div>This has nothing to do with my post you quoted?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1098877-changing-2e-kickstarter-i-m-lost?p=1100967#post1100967\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Disclosure: I have no personal stake in &quot;Hill's CtL2 vs Rose's CtL2&quot;. Just hoping that a good game comes out of all of this, and if people don't want to support Rose's version due to not being the version they were initially sold on, that's their prerogative)</div> </div> </div> </div>I have no doubt a good game will come of it, as I said earlier. I'm just disappointed that it will come at the expense of the other good game they'd been previewing prior to David's departure. I really enjoyed what we had seen of that game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":269,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","user":"Charlaquin","date":". 06-06-2017, 06:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-06T15:26:26-07:00","id":1100982,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1098877-changing-2e-kickstarter-i-m-lost?p=1100979#post1100979\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This has nothing to do with my post you quoted?</div> </div> </div> </div>More of a general thing on the &quot;maybe someone on OPP can clarify what's left of Hill's CtL2&quot; and your post was the most recent to do so. <br /> <br /> And because I weirdly haven't seen that bit from that post get discussed outside of that thread.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-06T15:36:16-07:00","id":1100987,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1098877-changing-2e-kickstarter-i-m-lost?p=1100982#post1100982\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">More of a general thing on the &quot;maybe someone on OPP can clarify what's left of Hill's CtL2&quot; and your post was the most recent to do so.</div> </div> </div> </div>I said that clarifying <i>what</i> will remain of David's Changeling in Rose's Changeling (which to be clear I don't expect them to do) would definitely help relieve my agita over the whole situation. But the conversation you linked to was about clarifying <i>why</i> a different direction was taken, which, as Rich stated, they had already made clear they have no intention of doing. And understandably so, that's business stuff and it wouldn't be very professional of them to discuss it publicly.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1098877-changing-2e-kickstarter-i-m-lost?p=1100982#post1100982\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And because I weirdly haven't seen that bit from that post get discussed outside of that thread.</div> </div> </div> </div>There's not really much about it to discuss. Haley's name wasn't included under the list of Dark Era's Companion authors on DrivethruRPG due to the limit of names Drivethru puts on the number of authors that can be listed. She insinuated that it was because she supported David Hill, and Rich said that wasn't the case. There's really no other productive discussion to be had there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-06T15:43:55-07:00","id":1100990,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1098877-changing-2e-kickstarter-i-m-lost?p=1100987#post1100987\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I said that clarifying <i>what</i> will remain of David's Changeling in Rose's Changeling (which to be clear I don't expect them to do) would definitely help relieve my agita over the whole situation. But the conversation you linked to was about clarifying <i>why</i> a different direction was taken, which, as Rich stated, they had already made clear they have no intention of doing. And understandably so, that's business stuff and it wouldn't be very professional of them to discuss it publicly.</div> </div> </div> </div>...and I was under the impression the two were linked? By explaining &quot;what&quot; was changed, this makes &quot;why&quot; the changes were made more clear.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> There's not really much about it to discuss. Haley's name wasn't included under the list of Dark Era's Companion authors on DrivethruRPG due to the limit of names Drivethru puts on the number of authors that can be listed. She insinuated that it was because she supported David Hill, and Rich said that wasn't the case. There's really no other productive discussion to be had there. </div> </div> </div>Not that part. Just the part of RichT saying that they would not be discussing anymore the circumstances surrounding Hill leaving and how it affects Changeling. AKA the part I had bolded.<br /> <br /> ...whatever, this is getting nowhere.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-06T16:30:29-07:00","id":1101013,"title":"","content":"I'm in the same boat as Charlaquin. Hill's Changeling looked like everything I loved about 1e brought to the forefront of the game, and between the prospect of much of that being lost and my general grievances over the circumstances of his leaving I just really can't see myself being excited for this game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-06T17:15:43-07:00","id":1101030,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1098877-changing-2e-kickstarter-i-m-lost?p=1100990#post1100990\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">...and I was under the impression the two were linked? By explaining &amp;quot;what&amp;quot; was changed, this makes &amp;quot;why&amp;quot; the changes were made more clear.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't really see how. And anyway, we will eventually see exactly what changed when the final product releases. Anyway, I never expected them to tell us what's going to change, just stating that doing so would certainly ease my mind more than another open development blog would.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1098877-changing-2e-kickstarter-i-m-lost?p=1100990#post1100990\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not that part. Just the part of RichT saying that they would not be discussing anymore the circumstances surrounding Hill leaving and how it affects Changeling. AKA the part I had bolded.</div> </div> </div> </div>What more is there to discuss about that? They're not planning to discuss that stuff publicly. This shouldn't be surprising, companies very rarely if ever publicly discuss the reasons for employees leaving. It's also not new information, they pretty clearly stated as much in a Monday meeting notes the week David's departure became public.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-06T18:46:23-07:00","id":1101065,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1098877-changing-2e-kickstarter-i-m-lost?p=1100979#post1100979\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I have no doubt a good game will come of it, as I said earlier. I'm just disappointed that it will come at the expense of the other good game they'd been previewing prior to David's departure. I really enjoyed what we had seen of that game.</div> </div> </div> </div>But we still don't know how much of Hill's work was scrapped, and how much of it remains under a different name, don't we? Unless I'm missing some critical piece here, that is. All I know is the stuff from these forums, and so far to me the sample Court (the Autumn Court) and the Hedge preview follow in spirit their previous previews.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-06T19:13:22-07:00","id":1101075,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1098877-changing-2e-kickstarter-i-m-lost?p=1101065#post1101065\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> But we still don't know how much of Hill's work was scrapped, and how much of it remains under a different name, don't we? Unless I'm missing some critical piece here, that is. All I know is the stuff from these forums, and so far to me the sample Court (the Autumn Court) and the Hedge preview follow in spirit their previous previews.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd certainly be glad if that was all that was changing. Goblin Contracts also changed, which I know most people never saw the previous version. For what it's worth, I think the changes there were an improvement. Also Contracts in general seem to have Regalia now, which hints at changes to Contracts and Seemings, though we don't yet know to what extent. Changes to Courts mean changes to Huntsmen, unless the new version somehow incorporates Yearning, though again we don't know to what extent. And it's possible other things might change that we can't infer from the latest previews.<br /> <br /> It's all those &quot;we don't know&quot;s that give me anxiety. If I at least knew what not to bother hoping will remain intact, I could switch gears and get ready to hype myself up for Rose's game. But as long as any part of David's game could be next on the chopping block without any warning, I'm not going to be able to &quot;just relax&quot; and be content with the knowledge that the final product will be a good game.<br /> <br /> I'm reminded of a joke Mark Hamill told about his surprise at finding out what the extent of his role in Force Awakens would be.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ghHgrjT_Hfk\" data-code=\"ghHgrjT_Hfk\" data-provider=\"youtube_share\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/ghHgrjT_Hfk/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> The first ~2 minutes is the relevant bit. Ultimately, the point he seems to be making is that people take big news better when you prepare them for it. Not having been prepared for big changes to the court system or the hedge, many fans, myself included did not take it as well as we might have if we had been better prepared.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-06T19:21:23-07:00","id":1101078,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1098877-changing-2e-kickstarter-i-m-lost?p=1101065#post1101065\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">sample Court (the Autumn Court) and the Hedge preview follow in spirit their previous previews.</div> </div> </div> </div>Considering the main pillar behind the those two things were completely changed I'm surprised by this.<br /> <br /> &quot;Otherworld where things are different&quot; doesn't really follow the spirit of &quot;the beauty which can come from pain&quot;<br /> <br /> And &quot;there is a bargain with the fae&quot; didn't really follow the spirit of &quot;make your courts narrative so powerful that creatures of narrative have to follow it's beats and tropes&quot;.<br /> <br /> To be clear, I'm not saying the new things are bad, just saying they have a different spirit in my mind and was surprised.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-08T07:12:36-07:00","id":1101629,"title":"","content":"How would one go about explaining how a finished product will look when it is unfinished? I swear it's like people want to discourage open development. Hard to believe anybody would want to offer any previews. Whatever happens is going to happen. Worrying about something beyond your control is about as useful as a one-legged man at an ass-kicking contest. There is no point in even addressing any concerns unless there will be a kickstarter because by the time the questions can be answered the book would be ready for print soon enough.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1526-diggs","name":"Diggs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"986"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}